Z||000002||pherder||09-04-2001||11:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MikeSchaefer:<BR><B>Does anyone know where I could order just that straight hood louver from a ferrari kit?<BR>Like this one on Roger's ferraro<BR> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Uh, Mike, they are probably fake ... i.e. on my Ferrari 308 kit they were just molded into the top of the hood skin.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/308_just_before_it_was_sold.jpg"> <P>Paul<BR><P>------------------<BR>--<BR>Paul Herder<BR>88 Formula - Artero kit car doner and 350 TPI<BR>86 SE - 3.2 w/440T4 Transaxle<BR>95 GMC - 350 TBI - Factory "Custom"<BR>92 Mazda Protege - Stock<BR>55 Jones - First Edition WIFE- all mods, equipment,updates :D<BR>Sedgwick, KS 67135||||reg||1
