Z||000004||fsrowsell||09-04-2001||11:48 PM||||Mike they can be made functional by cutting the bottoms out of the louvers on the inside of the hood. I did to my 328 kit and it worked great for letting the air flow through.<BR>Paul is right, they are part of the hood on the kits.||||reg||1
